  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ae309fc9b93c4434b888290b1d747f9a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TeacherInteraction
  playerMovement: {fileID: 1892934804}
  teacherName: Avalos
  dialoguePopUp: {fileID: 188390945}
  dialogueManager: {fileID: 2140464427}
  spellSelectionScreen: {fileID: 0}
  battleScreen: {fileID: 0}
  element: 
  totalNumOfElementSpells: 0
  battleCanvas: {fileID: 0}
  eventSystem: {fileID: 0}
  initalLines:
  - Hello there! You interested in chance?
  - Oh, magic.
  - Well, magic and chance go hand in hand.
  - "You\u2019ll be given opportunities to change and grow and it\u2019s your choice
    to take it. It\u2019s all a game of chance."
  - "Let\u2019s see what sort of chances you\u2019ll be given, roll these dice and
    get a two and six. If you struggle doing so I\u2019ll help boost your odds."
  afterPuzzleLines:
  - Fortune favors the bold.
  - "The odds are in my favor, but let\u2019s see if you can use your chances wisely."
  afterBattleLines:
  - I look forward to seeing the transformations you go through as you flourish.
  afterSpellLines:
  - 'Change is constant, you just need to become comfortable with the process. '
